 {
  "asset_id": "l5-dialogo-0-10-00d6ccdd3377",
  "lesson_id": 5,
  "uso": "diálogo, turnos 0–10",
  "category": "diálogo com múltiplas vozes",
  "transcript_version": 1,
  "transcript_hash": "00d6ccdd337706c3a2bdd68b6e0ac6abf769e98399dacd48e30771490963bb72",
  "inputs": [
   {
    "text": "OK, the turnover numbers for the second quarter. At Guarulhos, our largest site, voluntary turnover went from nine point two to fourteen point six percent. That's forty-eight people who left in three months.",
    "voice_id": "BIvP0GN1cAtSRTxNHnWS",
    "speaker": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "Sorry, Renata, was that fourteen or forty?",
    "voice_id": "Ha9f2JUQ4LL1bw2ZcNjS",
    "speaker": 2
   },
   {
    "text": "Fourteen. One four. Fourteen point six.",
    "voice_id": "BIvP0GN1cAtSRTxNHnWS",
    "speaker": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "And what does that cost us? Can you break that down for me?",
    "voice_id": "sfJopaWaOtauCD3HKX6Q",
    "speaker": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Just so I answer the right question, do you mean the total, or how we get to the total?",
    "voice_id": "BIvP0GN1cAtSRTxNHnWS",
    "speaker": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "How you get to it.",
    "voice_id": "sfJopaWaOtauCD3HKX6Q",
    "speaker": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Sure. We use an estimate of about four thousand eight hundred seventy dollars per exit. That covers recruiting, training, and the time a new person takes to get up to speed. Forty-eight times that is roughly two hundred thirty-four thousand dollars.",
    "voice_id": "BIvP0GN1cAtSRTxNHnWS",
    "speaker": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "OK. But is that money we actually spent, or money we lost?",
    "voice_id": "sfJopaWaOtauCD3HKX6Q",
    "speaker": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Good question. Part of it is spent, like the recruiting fees. Most of it is lost productivity, so you won't see it as one line in the budget.",
    "voice_id": "BIvP0GN1cAtSRTxNHnWS",
    "speaker": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "Then what would you need from us to bring it down?",
    "voice_id": "Ha9f2JUQ4LL1bw2ZcNjS",
    "speaker": 2
   },
   {
    "text": "Let me think about that for a second. What I'd need is a decision on the shift model before the end of the month.",
    "voice_id": "BIvP0GN1cAtSRTxNHnWS",
    "speaker": 0
   }
  ],
  "model_id": "eleven_v3",
  "endpoint": "text-to-dialogue",
