    "speaker": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "Then what would you need from us to bring it down?",
    "voice_id": "Ha9f2JUQ4LL1bw2ZcNjS",
    "speaker": 2
   },
   {
    "text": "Let me think about that for a second. What I'd need is a decision on the shift model before the end of the month.",
    "voice_id": "BIvP0GN1cAtSRTxNHnWS",
    "speaker": 0
   }
